sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + full intent as inputs, single Swamp Node, DECISIONS 1 (token minted at admission, vault.get), Gateway renders .env from the Project env template (orbit-gateway-renders-create-env; Nick 2026-11-01), budget rule swamp-operation-time-budgets (<10 s, 60 s).
  %% Tightened: flow-tighten 2026-11-02, rules 1-22 (rule 22: cfgmgmt file/systemd, 0600 credential file for the private fetch); 2026-11-03, rule 25 (minimal chart).
  %% Decided: Nick 2026-11-02, .env.testing only for an owned MySQL/PostgreSQL database, rendered by the Gateway and written by the same file step.
  %% Decided: Nick 2026-11-03, a web-serving Project gets its derived Route on the main path (requiresRoute); --domain overrides the domain; the Route reuses the route:create child.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: instance:create
  %% kind: instance.create
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as app-dev Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: instance:create 7 12 blog
  opt --database-server
    Note over GW: Plan the owned database
  end
  Note over GW: Validate, render .env<br/>reserve Instance, Route · #5121
  %%> Why the Route first:
  %%> - the Route changes the Process units, so the Gateway reserves it before it captures the Processes
  GW->>SW: Push token and .env<br/>vault: github-token, env-5121
  %%> Why:
  %%> - secrets reach the run only through the vault; no step calls the Gateway back (decision 1)
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-instance-create · 60 s
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>operation #5121
  SW->>N: Clone, check out branch<br/>file 0600 cred · git clone
  %%> Why the file:
  %%> - git reads the token from it, so the token never enters argv
  SW->>N: Write .env<br/>cfgmgmt/file · 0640 orbit-env
  opt --database-server
    SW->>N: Create owner and databases<br/>child operation-database-create
  end
  SW->>N: Run Project setup steps<br/>@swamp/ssh exec · in order
  SW->>N: Create, start Processes<br/>child operation-process-create
  %%> Why after setup:
  %%> - Processes need the installed dependencies
  SW->>N: Create the Route<br/>child operation-route-create
  %%> When:
  %%> - only for a web-serving Project
  alt all steps pass in budget
    N-->>SW: Site answers<br/>Processes running
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event · finish-result
    Note over GW: Record result<br/>commit · Instance 42 → active
  else a step fails or 60 s ends
    N--xSW: exit ≠ 0 or timeout
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>failed_step, error_code
    Note over GW: Keep Instance, mark failed<br/>task → failed · retry is new task
    %%> On failure:
    %%> - the Instance stays so you can see what happened; the Gateway never re-runs work by itself
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5121
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
